    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per day</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When you sleep, you can conduct a brief ritual where you can attempt to join another sleeping person you know in a shared dream for ten minutes, similar to the spell <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">dream council.</em> If the target is willing, you join them. Otherwise, they must succeed a Will save against your Spell or Class DC, whichever is higher. Once either you or your sleeping target awakens, the shared dream ends. At a GM’s discretion, someone who is sleeping but cannot dream is immune to this ability.</span></p>"
